# Night-shift harness config, sourced on the HOST by ~/.claude/nightshift/nightshift.sh
# (explicit env vars still win over this file).
#
# Turn cap per issue. Every wave-1/2 run (#1–#4) exhausted the default of 40 —
# the two that "passed" were simply green when cut off, and #3/#4 were parked
# with half-finished renames. One tech-spec §14 slice takes ~100+ agent turns
# (read spec + design doc, TDD several modules, wire the entry point, review, commit).
NIGHTSHIFT_MAX_TURNS=120
